<title>EGYPT: Egypt's Dakahleya Commercial Bank becomes United Bank of Egypt.</title>
<headline>Egypt's Dakahleya Commercial Bank becomes United Bank of Egypt.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The board of Egypt's private sector Dakahleya Commercial Bank has approved a decision to change the name of the bank to United Bank of Egypt, the bank said in an advertisement published on Monday.</p>
<p>The name change will be effective immediately, it added.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
